---
const title = "404";
const icon = "https://files.catbox.moe/vui2ub.jpg";
---

<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>404 · TQSY's Space</title>
  <link rel="icon" href={icon} />
  <style>
    :root { --miku-green: #00cfb5; --bg: #0a0a0c; --fg: #f5f5f7; --muted: #86868b; }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: light) { :root { --bg: #fcfcfc; --fg: #1d1d1f; --muted: #86868b; } }
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      min-height: 100dvh; display: grid; place-items: center; gap: 18px;
      background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg); text-align: center; padding: 24px;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, system-ui, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    }
    img { width: 72px; height: 72px; border-radius: 18px; object-fit: cover; }
    h1 { font-size: 2.4rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
    p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }
    a {
      margin-top: 8px; display: inline-block; padding: 10px 22px; border-radius: 50px;
      color: var(--miku-green); border: 1px solid var(--miku-green); text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; transition: background 0.3s, color 0.3s;
    }
    a:hover { background: var(--miku-green); color: var(--bg); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <img src={icon} alt="TQSY" width="72" height="72" />
  <h1>404</h1>
  <p>这个页面不存在，或者已经被我删掉了。</p>
  <a href="/">回到首页</a>
</body>
</html>
